          "target": "Medium-detent sheet reached from the keyboard upgrade nudge (jot://upgrade-engine) — a small state machine. If Jot's engine is already on the device, \"Use Jot's engine\" switches instantly with an in-sheet confirmation. On a stripped build where it isn't, \"Download & switch automatically\" queues a background, Wi-Fi download (usually while charging) and Jot switches over automatically when it lands — the sheet then shows \"Downloading…\" with a Stop download option, and a one-time \"You're on Jot's engine\" note appears on the home screen (EngineSwitchedCard). Ineligible device, low disk, and a failed download each keep Apple honestly (failed offers Try again). \"Keep Apple\" is a permanent decline. Same no-pressure tone as the donation card."
